# Run 3 audit: raw capture PNGs + the generated contact sheet are bulky and
# regenerable (via `app run capture`). The small annotations-*.json stay TRACKED
# so the audit is reproducible; the pixels do not bloat git.
games/Ranger-Adventures/runs/run-3-ux-polish/audit-evidence/*/
games/Ranger-Adventures/runs/run-3-ux-polish/audit-evidence/index.html

# Run B (P0.1) froze the Run A frames to audit-evidence-baseline-run-a/ BEFORE the
# first re-capture overwrites audit-evidence/. Same rule mirrored: the heavy PNGs +
# contact sheet stay on disk only; the annotations-*.json + README stay TRACKED so
# the frames F-01..F-34 cite remain reproducible without bloating git.
games/Ranger-Adventures/runs/run-3-ux-polish/audit-evidence-baseline-run-a/*/
games/Ranger-Adventures/runs/run-3-ux-polish/audit-evidence-baseline-run-a/index.html

